+    """``(parts[0].float() + parts[1].float() + ...).to(out_dtype)`` (FP32,
+    left to right, one rounding) in one kernel. ``parts`` is
+    ``(world, *shape)``; with ``self_part``, slot ``self_rank`` is read from
+    it instead of ``parts``."""
